1
00:00:08,103 --> 00:00:10,522
<font color="white">-好耶</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好耶</font></font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:14,776
<font color="white">-今天你出手阔绰耶</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-因为有一些临时收入</font></font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:16,069
<font color="white">算是副业吧</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:16,153 --> 00:00:19,489
<font color="white">你干了那么见不得光的勾当啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:19,573 --> 00:00:20,949
<font color="white">是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:21,033 --> 00:00:22,451
<font color="white">我不能透露太多</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:00:22,534 --> 00:00:26,955
<font color="white">总之是借助最近人气下滑的英雄得利</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:00:27,039 --> 00:00:30,500
<font color="white">-天啊 喂</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-那些报酬非常可观啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:00:33,295 --> 00:00:34,546
<font color="white">关于那件事</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:00:36,465 --> 00:00:39,092
<font color="white">能把详情说来听听吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:02:10,642 --> 00:02:12,060
<font color="white">机动奥特曼 最终季</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:02:14,187 --> 00:02:16,273
<font color="white">那个 这是…</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:02:20,110 --> 00:02:22,404
<font color="white">不会吧</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:02:23,029 --> 00:02:26,199
<font color="white">难道你就是第四人？</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:02:26,283 --> 00:02:27,325
<font color="white">第四人？</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:02:28,201 --> 00:02:30,579
<font color="white">是你袭击了我爸对吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:30,662 --> 00:02:33,373
<font color="white">我绝对不会原谅你的</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:02:33,456 --> 00:02:35,167
<font color="white">原来如此</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:02:35,250 --> 00:02:38,962
<font color="white">看来你还无法随心所欲地</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">控制那股能力</font></font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:02:39,045 --> 00:02:41,590
<font color="white">我该怎么办？</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:02:46,011 --> 00:02:49,014
<font color="white">我要在此立下大功了</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:02:49,097 --> 00:02:50,724
<font color="white">玲奈小姐 快逃</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:02:55,604 --> 00:02:57,772
<font color="white">你做什么啦？</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:04,362 --> 00:03:05,322
<font color="white">真是的</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:03:07,032 --> 00:03:08,158
<font color="white">不要过来</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:08,783 --> 00:03:09,951
<font color="white">放开我啦</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:13,079 --> 00:03:14,748
<font color="white">我都叫你住手了</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:42,234 --> 00:03:43,944
<font color="white">好痛 可恶啊</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:48,073 --> 00:03:49,866
<font color="white">你竟然让我如此费劲</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:04:02,379 --> 00:04:04,172
<font color="white">挺有一套的嘛</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:04:05,257 --> 00:04:06,424
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:04:06,508 --> 00:04:12,639
<font color="white">不过我也不能这样就善罢甘休</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:04:31,533 --> 00:04:32,367
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:04:36,579 --> 00:04:39,207
<font color="white">怎么回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:04:42,627 --> 00:04:45,630
<font color="white">扎拉比那家伙都没有联络我们</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:04:45,714 --> 00:04:47,090
<font color="white">他到底在做什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:04:47,966 --> 00:04:51,594
<font color="white">只要他可以履行自己的职责就行</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:04:51,678 --> 00:04:53,221
<font color="white">是喔</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:04:54,139 --> 00:04:57,392
<font color="white">好不容易孤立了那位奥特曼男孩</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:04:57,934 --> 00:04:59,686
<font color="white">如果被他逃掉我可不管</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:04:59,769 --> 00:05:01,062
<font color="white">不用担心</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:05:01,146 --> 00:05:04,274
<font color="white">科学特搜队正在全力追捕他</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:05:04,357 --> 00:05:09,571
<font color="white">也就是说有奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">互相厮杀的可能性了？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:05:10,447 --> 00:05:12,657
<font color="white">若变成那样就太有趣了</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:05:13,950 --> 00:05:15,910
<font color="white">或许可以好好利用呢</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:05:16,494 --> 00:05:19,748
<font color="white">我可没有义务受你指示</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:05:19,831 --> 00:05:22,625
<font color="white">我自会好好享受的</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:05:22,709 --> 00:05:23,918
<font color="white">再见啦</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:05:36,890 --> 00:05:40,018
<font color="white">那时奥特曼的失控举动</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:05:41,436 --> 00:05:46,816
<font color="white">铁定就是那征兆</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:05:49,319 --> 00:05:51,571
<font color="white">爸和玲奈小姐…</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:05:54,449 --> 00:05:57,619
<font color="white">但是我要怎么联系上她？</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:06:01,456 --> 00:06:05,210
{\an8}<font color="white">（《我的好天气》</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">佐山玲奈）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:06:05,293 --> 00:06:06,503
{\an8}<font color="white">（要一直保持这样的你喔）</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:06:09,631 --> 00:06:10,632
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:06:11,633 --> 00:06:13,384
<font color="white">这些数字…</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:06:16,429 --> 00:06:18,640
<font color="white">说不定倒过来看的话…</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:06:27,107 --> 00:06:29,234
<font color="white">你好 我是玲奈</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:06:29,317 --> 00:06:31,236
<font color="white">-那个…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-谢谢你的来电</font></font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:06:31,986 --> 00:06:35,115
<font color="white">抱歉 我现在无法接听电话</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:06:41,371 --> 00:06:42,497
<font color="white">玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:06:49,045 --> 00:06:51,422
<font color="white">果然是那么一回事啊</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:06:52,006 --> 00:06:53,299
<font color="white">到底是怎样？</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:06:53,383 --> 00:06:56,469
<font color="white">我突然变得像奥特曼耶</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:06:56,553 --> 00:06:58,304
<font color="white">不只是像</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:06:58,805 --> 00:07:01,015
<font color="white">怎么看都是奥特曼啊</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:07:01,891 --> 00:07:05,311
<font color="white">不 这情况应该称为“女奥特曼”吧</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:07:05,395 --> 00:07:07,147
<font color="white">怎么称呼都好啦</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:07:07,647 --> 00:07:09,941
<font color="white">贝姆拉为什么会想把这个给我爸？</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:07:10,024 --> 00:07:13,695
<font color="white">爸会被袭击和这颈链有关吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:07:13,778 --> 00:07:15,447
<font color="white">而且为什么会是我？</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:07:16,364 --> 00:07:19,659
<font color="white">都不知道该从哪里开始吐槽了</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:07:19,742 --> 00:07:21,411
<font color="white">我想也是</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:07:21,494 --> 00:07:23,288
<font color="white">总之请先冷静</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:07:23,371 --> 00:07:25,331
<font color="white">怎么有办法冷静啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:07:27,292 --> 00:07:29,294
<font color="white">为何我会遇到这种事？</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:07:31,546 --> 00:07:32,547
<font color="white">对了</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:07:33,339 --> 00:07:34,632
<font color="white">我要联络进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:07:34,716 --> 00:07:36,926
<font color="white">现在不能依赖学长</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:07:37,010 --> 00:07:38,344
<font color="white">我们找其他人吧</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:07:39,929 --> 00:07:40,930
<font color="white">等一下</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:07:41,973 --> 00:07:44,559
<font color="white">“学长”是指进次郎对吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:07:44,642 --> 00:07:46,019
<font color="white">为什么不能依赖他？</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:07:46,102 --> 00:07:47,270
<font color="white">你不知道吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:07:47,353 --> 00:07:50,023
<font color="white">学长现在出了一些状况</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:07:50,732 --> 00:07:51,941
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:07:54,611 --> 00:07:55,862
<font color="white">太郎先生</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:07:56,654 --> 00:07:57,697
<font color="white">为什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:07:58,406 --> 00:08:00,408
<font color="white">你果然在这里</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:08:02,744 --> 00:08:04,204
<font color="white">你在说什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:08:05,288 --> 00:08:09,709
<font color="white">你也认识那个叫佐山玲奈的女孩吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:08:09,792 --> 00:08:11,711
<font color="white">一追查她就找到你了</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:08:12,921 --> 00:08:14,130
<font color="white">玲奈小姐吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:08:15,715 --> 00:08:17,217
<font color="white">你想做什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:08:17,300 --> 00:08:20,470
<font color="white">不会对她做什么 我在追捕的是你</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:08:23,598 --> 00:08:27,101
<font color="white">现在请放我一马</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:08:27,185 --> 00:08:29,479
<font color="white">我必须过去</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:08:31,231 --> 00:08:33,900
<font color="white">不能让她卷入事件中</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:08:35,193 --> 00:08:37,111
<font color="white">我不会再让你逃掉了</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:08:38,571 --> 00:08:41,616
<font color="white">无论用什么方法我都要把你带回去</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:08:49,749 --> 00:08:51,000
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:09:13,856 --> 00:09:15,692
<font color="white">你觉得自己可以成功脱逃两次吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:09:17,443 --> 00:09:19,195
<font color="white">我只是换个地方</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:09:19,279 --> 00:09:20,947
<font color="white">如果我们认真对打</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:09:21,030 --> 00:09:22,949
<font color="white">会再次造成灾情</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:09:24,242 --> 00:09:28,037
<font color="white">我知道你没打算被捉住</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:09:28,913 --> 00:09:30,498
<font color="white">只能战斗了吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:09:35,336 --> 00:09:36,504
<font color="white">怎么会？</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:09:36,588 --> 00:09:37,589
<font color="white">（传送）</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:09:37,672 --> 00:09:39,591
<font color="white">难道是岚先生？</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:09:51,936 --> 00:09:53,563
<font color="white">传送成功了</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:09:55,481 --> 00:09:57,358
<font color="white">这样你就能使出全力了吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:10:00,653 --> 00:10:01,779
<font color="white">我要上了</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:10:05,867 --> 00:10:07,702
<font color="white">你在里面吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:10:07,785 --> 00:10:09,829
<font color="white">我回来了 进来吧</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:10:11,748 --> 00:10:13,625
<font color="white">嗨 好久不见</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:10:15,752 --> 00:10:18,671
<font color="white">突然回来是发生了什么事？</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:10:18,755 --> 00:10:22,008
<font color="white">抱歉 在这边有些杂事要处理</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:10:22,592 --> 00:10:25,178
<font color="white">有个麻烦的家伙跟我一起回来</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:10:25,261 --> 00:10:26,679
<font color="white">我被耽搁所以走不开</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:10:26,763 --> 00:10:28,514
<font color="white">我有件事想立刻问你…</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:10:28,598 --> 00:10:29,974
<font color="white">等一下</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:10:30,058 --> 00:10:33,603
<font color="white">在那之前 你没有其他要说的话吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:10:37,857 --> 00:10:38,858
<font color="white">我回来了</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:10:39,692 --> 00:10:41,903
<font color="white">好 欢迎回来</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:10:42,987 --> 00:10:44,280
<font color="white">怎么回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:10:44,781 --> 00:10:48,660
<font color="white">我有说过对吧？这也是我的家</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:10:48,743 --> 00:10:51,245
<font color="white">他就是养育我长大的亲人</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:10:52,872 --> 00:10:53,790
<font color="white">你好</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:10:53,873 --> 00:10:56,417
<font color="white">是你的女朋友吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:10:56,501 --> 00:10:58,252
<font color="white">不知不觉中就长大了啊</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:10:58,336 --> 00:11:01,798
<font color="white">我们不是那种关系</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你看她脖子上的东西</font></font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:11:05,051 --> 00:11:07,553
<font color="white">她就是那个女孩啊</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:12,975
<font color="white">确实很像</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:11:13,976 --> 00:11:15,520
<font color="white">什么意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:11:15,603 --> 00:11:16,437
<font color="white">话说回来</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:11:17,605 --> 00:11:19,982
<font color="white">我想知道为什么自己会变成奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:11:20,066 --> 00:11:21,609
<font color="white">冷静点</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:11:23,986 --> 00:11:27,073
<font color="white">她的装甲是大叔做的吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:11:27,657 --> 00:11:30,118
<font color="white">为什么贝姆拉会盯上她？</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:11:30,701 --> 00:11:33,037
<font color="white">不是这样的</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:11:33,955 --> 00:11:36,874
<font color="white">不是贝姆拉盯上那女孩</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:11:38,418 --> 00:11:40,878
<font color="white">是她吸引了贝姆拉</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:11:42,046 --> 00:11:42,964
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:11:45,091 --> 00:11:47,468
<font color="white">这是什么意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:12:07,405 --> 00:12:11,993
<font color="white">进次郎 你认真起来</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">就只有那种程度吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:12:19,625 --> 00:12:21,919
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:12:25,715 --> 00:12:27,425
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:12:29,594 --> 00:12:32,638
<font color="white">你说她吸引了贝姆拉是什么意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:12:32,722 --> 00:12:36,267
<font color="white">贝姆拉突然来找</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">在美国的我并这么说…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:12:37,143 --> 00:12:42,356
<font color="white">在她唤醒本来的力量前</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:12:43,691 --> 00:12:46,736
<font color="white">必须事先进行准备</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:12:48,613 --> 00:12:51,949
<font color="white">然后他叫我做出她能穿的装甲</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:12:54,118 --> 00:12:55,953
<font color="white">这么说来…</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:12:56,037 --> 00:12:57,705
<font color="white">这么说来？</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:12:58,414 --> 00:13:01,459
<font color="white">你知道我身材实际上的三围？</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:13:05,213 --> 00:13:06,088
<font color="white">然后呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:13:06,172 --> 00:13:09,217
<font color="white">详情我没有多问</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:13:09,300 --> 00:13:12,178
<font color="white">我可不想被卷进麻烦事里</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:13:14,055 --> 00:13:15,640
<font color="white">我很好奇</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:13:15,723 --> 00:13:16,933
<font color="white">好奇哪一点？</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:13:17,016 --> 00:13:19,769
<font color="white">我不是那个意思啦</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:13:20,436 --> 00:13:25,691
<font color="white">贝姆拉是说“在她唤醒</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">本来的力量前”对吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:13:26,275 --> 00:13:27,401
<font color="white">是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:13:28,569 --> 00:13:33,241
<font color="white">这表示你从最初就是</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">应当成为奥特曼的存在</font></font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:13:34,075 --> 00:13:35,201
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:13:35,785 --> 00:13:38,204
<font color="white">我能说的只有这些</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:13:40,081 --> 00:13:41,499
<font color="white">远藤玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:13:42,375 --> 00:13:45,586
<font color="white">你到底是何方神圣？</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:13:46,921 --> 00:13:49,298
<font color="white">就算你问我 我也不知道</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:13:56,305 --> 00:13:58,224
<font color="white">我知道了 我会告诉你的</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:13:58,975 --> 00:14:03,521
<font color="white">我们事前就听说会发生</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">之前的奥特曼事件</font></font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:14:04,564 --> 00:14:05,523
<font color="white">继续说</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:14:06,315 --> 00:14:10,027
<font color="white">我们被要求趁此骚动时</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:14:10,111 --> 00:14:12,363
<font color="white">到嵯峨吉町住宅区肆意闯空门</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:14:12,446 --> 00:14:13,698
<font color="white">闯空门？</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:14:13,781 --> 00:14:17,660
<font color="white">不仅能轻易闯空门</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">还有额外报酬可以拿</font></font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:14:17,743 --> 00:14:19,328
<font color="white">没有比这更好的差事了吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:14:21,247 --> 00:14:24,917
<font color="white">工作内容应该不只那些吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:27,461
<font color="white">我说就是了</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:14:28,379 --> 00:14:29,839
<font color="white">还要调查关于十几年前</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:14:29,922 --> 00:14:35,344
<font color="white">曾居住于该处的小孩的事</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">相关情报全都要据实回报</font></font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:14:36,387 --> 00:14:39,807
<font color="white">十几年前的小孩的情报？</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:14:41,267 --> 00:14:42,184
<font color="white">这样够了吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:14:42,268 --> 00:14:44,478
<font color="white">指派那项工作给你的</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:14:45,354 --> 00:14:46,439
<font color="white">是这家伙吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:14:48,649 --> 00:14:51,235
<font color="white">不 并非是他…</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:14:52,612 --> 00:14:56,240
<font color="white">去哪里可以见到他？</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:14:56,324 --> 00:14:57,700
<font color="white">我会说的</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:14:58,284 --> 00:14:59,660
<font color="white">都说了我会告诉你啦</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:15:24,560 --> 00:15:25,645
<font color="white">被灭口了吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:15:26,979 --> 00:15:28,522
<font color="white">这道伤口…</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:15:33,444 --> 00:15:36,238
<font color="white">不好了 新的奥特曼…</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:15:41,285 --> 00:15:42,787
<font color="white">到底发生了什么事？</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:15:47,458 --> 00:15:50,086
<font color="white">看来终于找到你了</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:16:36,549 --> 00:16:39,385
<font color="white">太郎先生 已经够了</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:16:39,468 --> 00:16:41,929
<font color="white">你的意思是我打不赢你吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:16:42,471 --> 00:16:43,973
<font color="white">不是的</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:16:44,056 --> 00:16:47,560
<font color="white">在我们打斗的当下</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">玲奈小姐可能正陷入危险之中</font></font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:16:47,643 --> 00:16:50,521
{\an8}<font color="white">我只是想要救她</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:16:56,235 --> 00:16:57,611
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:16:58,195 --> 00:17:00,740
<font color="white">你是为了什么成为奥特曼的？</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:17:00,823 --> 00:17:02,867
<font color="white">对你来说奥特曼是什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:17:04,285 --> 00:17:05,953
<font color="white">为什么要问我那些？</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:17:06,746 --> 00:17:11,625
<font color="white">那时候你努力想证明自己的清白</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:17:11,709 --> 00:17:14,837
<font color="white">这家伙假扮成奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:17:15,379 --> 00:17:17,673
<font color="white">全都是他谋划的诡计</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:17:18,174 --> 00:17:21,052
<font color="white">在我看来你当时</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:17:21,135 --> 00:17:23,137
<font color="white">只是一心想为早田先生报仇</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:17:23,721 --> 00:17:27,224
<font color="white">可是你现在却说想要救某个人</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:17:27,808 --> 00:17:30,728
<font color="white">告诉我你真实的想法吧</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:17:36,358 --> 00:17:37,526
<font color="white">在逃走后</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:17:38,277 --> 00:17:39,487
<font color="white">我变成孤身一人</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:17:40,029 --> 00:17:43,324
<font color="white">我心里想着很多人的事</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">然后接受了别人的帮助</font></font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:17:45,576 --> 00:17:46,744
<font color="white">最终我意识到</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:17:47,787 --> 00:17:52,583
<font color="white">如果我步上爸一路走来的道路</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:17:53,334 --> 00:17:55,461
<font color="white">也许就会知道答案了</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:17:57,004 --> 00:18:01,383
{\an8}<font color="white">关于我应该成为什么样的奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:18:02,968 --> 00:18:06,430
<font color="white">所以我不能在这里止步</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:18:09,767 --> 00:18:11,519
<font color="white">你说得对</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:18:11,602 --> 00:18:13,729
<font color="white">这就是我希望从你口中听到的话</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:18:25,783 --> 00:18:26,867
<font color="white">诸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:18:28,077 --> 00:18:30,162
<font color="white">你把他逼到这里了 做得很好</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:18:30,663 --> 00:18:32,248
<font color="white">接下来我会处理</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:18:33,290 --> 00:18:37,128
<font color="white">不 请让我对付他</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:18:37,211 --> 00:18:38,712
<font color="white">好吧</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:18:41,090 --> 00:18:42,049
<font color="white">这样的话…</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:18:42,591 --> 00:18:43,551
{\an8}<font color="white">太郎先生</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:18:54,603 --> 00:18:56,397
<font color="white">果然是假冒的</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:18:57,898 --> 00:19:01,902
<font color="white">每次都会掉入相同的陷阱呢</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:19:06,323 --> 00:19:07,908
<font color="white">这下我明白了</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:19:08,617 --> 00:19:12,413
<font color="white">你们从一开始就计划要将</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">进次郎逼入绝境对吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:19:13,539 --> 00:19:15,666
<font color="white">若在那场复兴纪念典礼发生的事件</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:19:15,749 --> 00:19:19,170
<font color="white">如进次郎所言是假冒者所为</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:19:19,253 --> 00:19:20,880
<font color="white">一切就解释得通了</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:19:21,881 --> 00:19:25,342
<font color="white">而且我现在亲自确认了这个</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">假冒奥特曼的存在</font></font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:19:25,968 --> 00:19:28,304
<font color="white">进次郎说的果然没错</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:19:28,387 --> 00:19:30,931
<font color="white">你还是一样热血过头呢</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:19:31,015 --> 00:19:33,267
<font color="white">太郎先生 你从一开始就…</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:19:33,350 --> 00:19:34,977
<font color="white">是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:19:35,060 --> 00:19:36,437
<font color="white">所以这身装甲也是…</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:19:38,022 --> 00:19:39,607
<font color="white">我将一切都赌在你身上</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:19:40,691 --> 00:19:44,486
<font color="white">你们的目的是把奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">塑造成灾害般的存在吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:19:45,613 --> 00:19:48,407
<font color="white">如此露骨地揭露我们的计谋</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:19:48,490 --> 00:19:50,659
<font color="white">会让我想认真跟你打啊</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:19:51,911 --> 00:19:54,413
<font color="white">我不会再让你们得逞了</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:19:55,331 --> 00:19:57,958
<font color="white">-要上了 进次郎</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好</font></font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:20:34,828 --> 00:20:36,288
<font color="white">不能掉以轻心</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:20:45,422 --> 00:20:47,675
<font color="white">-我说你们啊 这样很危险</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-抱歉</font></font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:21:22,918 --> 00:21:24,003
<font color="white">上吧</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:21:34,555 --> 00:21:35,639
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:21:35,723 --> 00:21:38,350
<font color="white">你确实赢了赌注</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:21:38,434 --> 00:21:39,852
<font color="white">我就承认这点吧</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:21:39,935 --> 00:21:41,812
<font color="white">然后把自己当作诱饵</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:21:41,895 --> 00:21:45,816
<font color="white">证明同伴清白的行动也让我陶醉</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:21:45,899 --> 00:21:47,234
<font color="white">但是呢…</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:21:49,653 --> 00:21:52,239
<font color="white">这场胜负是我们赢了</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:21:52,323 --> 00:21:54,450
<font color="white">虽然和原先计划的顺序不同</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:21:54,533 --> 00:21:57,328
<font color="white">但还是先把首要目标的你解决掉吧</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:21:57,411 --> 00:21:58,704
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:21:58,787 --> 00:22:01,123
<font color="white">你可别恨我喔</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:22:05,294 --> 00:22:07,963
<font color="white">这是什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:22:17,473 --> 00:22:18,640
<font color="white">那是…</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:24:05,038 --> 00:24:08,125
<font color="white">字幕翻译：梁雪莹</font><font color="white"></font>

